,"url":"https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiqgFBVV95cUxQM2VYdkhoTmFIaXFhbmdyalRhT2VtYkpMbW1wa0J3NldKLWZHUFM2WG5kN0taSV9jczJHOWJSeWhJcldZTmhFZlEzeFlNcTgtc2UwTjdKR0U4VS1GNkZ6VE9Jc3M3X3BQamlOc3dWQjVzcVMtOV8yRHhpalVCcVYxMWtkQUJ5Y3ZZbjRSYmRVeVBMckgwaFpnVG8zckw1eU5PVXVQR1pWdVZtdw?oc=5","date":"2026-10-22","zh":"CSX 飆升 7%，創紀錄的收入和上調的指引帶來“強勁的盈利增長”"},{"title":"StoneX reiterates Buy on CSX stock after earnings beat estimates By Investing.com","src":"Investing.com Nigeria","url":"https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiwwFBVV95cUxQaThHMUhzUmd2dEtZMU41aGFwUlZTNDBTVkdhdnhqczRJa2kwdjhxaDFmS0FtajJabE1TTUhhc0dDZmVDOWh6OU5TT211WUxEZTZVdGZ0czRIQVgtOEstaGxCQ0NIUzhIZmFnTGFPeTlsaFJJWktILXIzMnY4TldYMjllR296SlRMNVZtUVc5WGRhRllCSUdrdHRUNUJqMDNkS1RVUm9YbnBPcGQ5T2RpMi0yLW45cHhlQXkxMlRMaURza2M?oc=5","date":"2026-10-22","zh":"獲利超出預期後 StoneX 重申買進 CSX 股票"},{"title":"CSX (CSX) Q3 2026 Earnings Call Transcript","src":"The Globe and Mail","url":"https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMixAFBVV95cUxPUi1CekFaUVRKZXluMGprQ1VUYS10QmRKS1NWT0RTSmtuY0hvdW5zMzU3bWtyLXVwUmgwUXVySHpUWlpPRG56cV9KSXRjanVnUXVBa0MwX2xwUld3Vnl6X1k5S1paNEpvMkdrdnBaMDJBTFZFZlFGT3o5aFZRbzNvUXp1by1rUWZxUmJteUd2dk9LVjdXNzU4bDh1TXVPeG4zaG10c2hubXFZMS1kQy1aR1dTOGVYejRYendNQjA3X3R6Vmdj?oc=5","date":"2026-10-22","zh":"CSX (CSX) 2026 年第三季財報電話會議紀錄"}],"themes":[{"name":"財報","count":7},{"name":"分析師評等","count":4}],"biz":{"tenk":{"form":"10-K","date":"2026-02-12","period":"2025-12-31","url":"https://www.sec.gov/Archives/edgar/data/277948/000027794826000006/csx-20251231.htm"},"overview":[{"en":"CSX Corporation, together with its subsidiaries (\"CSX\" or the \"Company\"), based in Jacksonville, Florida, is one of the nation's leading transportation companies. The Company provides rail-based freight transportation services including traditional rail service, the transport of intermodal containers and trailers, as well as other transportation services such as rail-to-truck transfers and bulk commodity operations. CSX and the rail industry provide customers with access to an expansive and interconnected transportation network that plays a key role in North American commerce and is critical to the long-term economic success and improved global competitiveness of the United States. In addition, freight railroads provide the most economical and environmentally efficient means to transport goods over land.","zh":null},{"en":"CSX's principal operating subsidiary, CSX Transportation, Inc. (\"CSXT\"), provides an important link to the transportation supply chain through its approximately 20,000 route-mile rail network and serves major population centers in 26 states east of the Mississippi River, the District of Columbia and the Canadian provinces of Ontario and Quebec. It has access to over 70 ocean, river and lake port terminals along the Atlantic and Gulf Coasts, the Mississippi River, the Great Lakes and the St. Lawrence Seaway. This access allows the Company to meet the dynamic transportation needs of manufacturers, industrial producers, the automotive industry, construction companies, farmers and feed mills, wholesalers and retailers, and energy producers. The Company's intermodal business links customers to railroads via trucks and terminals. CSXT also serves thousands of production and distribution facili","zh":null},{"en":"CSXT is also responsible for the Company's real estate sales, leasing, acquisition and management and development activities. Substantially all of these activities are focused on supporting railroad operations.","zh":null}],"markets":[],"customers":[{"en":"The intermodal business shipped 3.0 million units (48% of volume) and generated $2.1 billion in revenue (15% of revenue) in 2025. The intermodal business combines the superior economics of rail transportation with the flexibility of trucks and offers a cost and environmental advantage over long-haul trucking. Through a network of approximately 30 terminals, the intermodal business serves all major markets east of the Mississippi River and transports mainly manufactured consumer goods in containers, providing customers with truck-like service for longer shipments.","zh":null}],"competition":[{"en":"The business environment in which the Company operates is highly competitive. Shippers typically select transportation providers that offer the most compelling combination of service and price. Service requirements, both in terms of transit time and reliability, vary by shipper and commodity. As a result, the Company's primary competition varies by commodity, geographic location and mode of available transportation and includes other railroads, motor carriers that operate similar routes across its service area and, to a less significant extent, barges, ships and pipelines.","zh":null},{"en":"CSXT's primary rail competitor is Norfolk Southern Railway, which operates throughout much of the Company's territory. During 2025, Norfolk Southern Railway entered into an agreement to merge with Union Pacific Railroad to form the nation's only transcontinental rail network, which requires the approval of the Surface Transportation Board. Other railroads also operate in parts of the Company's territory. Depending on the specific market, competing railroads and deregulated motor carriers may exert pressure on price and service levels. For further discussion on the risk of competition to the Company, see","zh":null}],"segments":{"seg":{"end":"2025-12-31","items":[{"name":"Rail","val":13276000000,"zh":"Rail"},{"name":"Trucking","val":839000000,"zh":"Trucking"}],"total":14100000000},"prod":{"end":"2025-12-31","items":[{"name":"Total Merchandise","val":8800000000,"zh":"Total Merchandise"},{"name":"Chemicals","val":2776000000,"zh":"Chemicals"},{"name":"Intermodal","val":2100000000,"zh":"Intermodal"},{"name":"Coal Services","val":1900000000,"zh":"Coal Services"},{"name":"Agriculturaland Food Products","val":1618000000,"zh":"Agriculturaland Food Products"},{"name":"Automotive","val":1182000000,"zh":"汽車"},{"name":"Forest Products","val":975000000,"zh":"Forest Products"},{"name":"Metalsand Equipment","val":869000000,"zh":"Metalsand Equipment"},{"name":"Minerals","val":832000000,"zh":"Minerals"},{"name":"Trucking","val":816000000,"zh":"Trucking"}],"total":14100000000}},"peers":["NSC","UNP","CNI","CP","DE"]}}